                "retweet_count": 21,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I will chair a joint Subcommittee hearing in @JudiciaryGOP on Obamacare subsidy fraud. After 15 years, it\u2019s clear the Obamacare experiment is nothing more than a laundry list of broken promises. Premiums have skyrocketed, patient choice has been taken away, billions of taxpayer dollars have been abused, and health insurance companies have been further enriched.\n\nA new report by GAO exposed how the Obamacare exchange has been riddled with fraud. In plan year 2025, GAO created 20 fake identities and submitted applications on the Obamacare exchange. 19 of the 20 applicants received subsidized coverage, and coverage for 18 of the fake applicants remained active as of September 2025.",
